01:00:24,560 --> 01:00:26,387
His daddy Benny Demaret...

727
01:00:26,479 --> 01:00:28,721
seems like he's Just under
the top guys.

728
01:00:28,814 --> 01:00:31,768
Holy shit, Stan. An underboss?

729
01:00:34,612 --> 01:00:36,854
Look, we're not
rousting Juvies here.

730
01:00:36,948 --> 01:00:39,070
They're not Just gonna
let this go, that kind of money.

731
01:00:39,158 --> 01:00:41,032
They're gonna call their uncles
and their fathers...

732
01:00:41,118 --> 01:00:42,660
and they're gonna come here
looking for the money.

733
01:00:42,745 --> 01:00:44,453
The place
is gonna be crawling with 'em.

734
01:00:44,538 --> 01:00:47,954
You're watching too darn much
of that satellite, Donnie.

735
01:00:50,378 --> 01:00:52,121
Nobody's comin'
to this marine's town...

736
01:00:52,213 --> 01:00:54,455
and doing a damn thing.

737
01:00:54,548 --> 01:00:57,336
Just think about it.
They can't Just call...

738
01:00:57,426 --> 01:00:59,798
and say they lost the money.
They'd have done it already.

739
01:00:59,887 --> 01:01:02,592
They do that, they end up
in a barrel of acid...

740
01:01:02,681 --> 01:01:05,137
or whatever else they do
with their bodies these days.

741
01:01:05,226 --> 01:01:06,388
I see what you're saying.

742
01:01:06,477 --> 01:01:08,683
I Just don't figure on them
leaving empty-handed.

743
01:01:12,483 --> 01:01:16,611
See, that's the thing.
We can't let 'em leave.

744
01:01:25,371 --> 01:01:28,574
I'll tell you one thing,
next time l see those fucks...

745
01:01:28,666 --> 01:01:30,824
I'm gonna be packin'.

746
01:01:30,918 --> 01:01:33,491
