747
01:02:02,908 --> 01:02:05,115
I'm sorry, Johnny.

748
01:02:12,418 --> 01:02:15,787
That is a big Heartland Lodge
buck right there.

749
01:02:15,879 --> 01:02:17,208
Feature this.

750
01:02:17,298 --> 01:02:21,165
State senate thinks they can
tell me how to run my shop.

751
01:02:21,260 --> 01:02:24,629
So, yeah, there is
a three-day waiting period...

752
01:02:24,722 --> 01:02:27,426
technically.
But that's mostly enforceable...

753
01:02:27,516 --> 01:02:30,967
for your garden variety
Latino stick-up men...

754
