which you boys
don't appear to be.

755
01:02:34,648 --> 01:02:36,937
No, sir. Definitely not.

756
01:02:37,026 --> 01:02:40,477
Listen, l appreciate
you moving this along for us.

757
01:02:40,571 --> 01:02:42,978
Here's a bill
for all your trouble.

758
01:02:58,005 --> 01:02:59,962
They trouble? l thought
they would be trouble.

759
01:03:00,049 --> 01:03:02,171
No. No. No trouble.
Ouestion 'em, mostly.

760
01:03:02,259 --> 01:03:03,718
Just question 'em.

761
01:03:03,802 --> 01:03:06,969
Just wanna
yoggle-doggle with 'em.

762
01:03:07,055 --> 01:03:09,926
You give me a call
if you see 'em.

763
01:03:10,017 --> 01:03:11,974
You sure nobody from out of town
has been here?

764
01:03:12,060 --> 01:03:15,180
No. Oh, out of town.

765
01:03:15,272 --> 01:03:17,561
Yeah, John Heater
come up from Beach.

766
01:03:17,649 --> 01:03:19,772
Had a party goin' huntin'
up Big Timber.

767
01:03:19,860 --> 01:03:23,774
- No strangers?
- No stranger than you.

768
01:04:01,985 --> 01:04:05,401
- I gotta say this one time.
- What's that?

769
01:04:07,908 --> 01:04:09,367
You and Scarpa
take the car and drive.

770
01:04:09,451 --> 01:04:12,535
Leave me here with Marbles.
It's his fault anyway.

771
01:04:12,621 --> 01:04:16,784
Are you serious?
No, there's no way.

772
01:04:16,875 --> 01:04:19,662
It's not even a choice.

773
01:04:19,753 --> 01:04:23,336
Matty, l'm not Just talking
about this little field trip.

774
01:04:23,423 --> 01:04:26,294
I'm talking about all of it.

775
01:04:29,179 --> 01:04:31,800
You had it right
in the first place.

776
01:04:31,890 --> 01:04:35,674
Looking for a regular Job,
being a citizen.

777
01:04:35,769 --> 01:04:38,474
