780
01:04:46,905 --> 01:04:49,478
Matty, for ninety-nine guys
out of a hundred...

781
01:04:49,574 --> 01:04:53,323
this is lose-lose.

782
01:04:53,412 --> 01:04:56,827
It's not like the way
it was thirty years ago.

783
01:04:56,915 --> 01:04:58,872
It's not like the stories
your uncle was telling us...

784
01:04:58,959 --> 01:05:00,417
when we were growing up.

785
01:05:00,502 --> 01:05:04,963
Now it's either a bullet
in the back of your head...

786
01:05:05,048 --> 01:05:07,539
or Jail for life.

787
01:05:13,390 --> 01:05:15,133
Just snap it back in there.

788
01:05:27,028 --> 01:05:30,812
So you know all this, but l
don't see you trying to get out.

789
01:05:30,907 --> 01:05:36,150
I said you. Come on,
we're talking about you, here.

790
01:05:49,551 --> 01:05:53,216
Sorry l got you into this,
Taylor.

791
01:05:53,305 --> 01:05:55,511
It's Just more
of the same for me.

792
01:05:55,599 --> 01:05:59,382
Just more of the same.

793
01:06:37,015 --> 01:06:40,965
You fellas are on a real
busman's holiday, aren't ya?

794
01:06:41,061 --> 01:06:42,471
Hey, look at you.

795
01:06:42,562 --> 01:06:46,773
You roll into town with
more guys than Sinatra, right?

796
01:06:48,485 --> 01:06:50,608
Teddy, l Just want you to know
how truly sorry l am.

797
01:06:50,695 --> 01:06:52,439
I know l fucked this up
right from the get...

798
01:06:52,530 --> 01:06:54,772
but l'm gonna do everything
l can to make it right.

799
01:06:56,284 --> 01:06:59,451
Marbles, that voice
is cutting right through me.

800
01:06:59,537 --> 01:07:02,906
You are unlikable.
If it wasn't for Matty...

801
01:07:02,999 --> 01:07:05,205
