802
01:07:05,293 --> 01:07:08,709
As it is, l'd like to kick you
through the uprights...

803
01:07:08,796 --> 01:07:11,370
Iike a fuckin' field goal.

804
01:07:14,969 --> 01:07:17,377
So, where are we at?

805
01:07:21,351 --> 01:07:23,390
We've had a wrinkle.

806
01:07:29,817 --> 01:07:33,483
- Cops are involved.
- Dirty fuckin' cops.

807
01:07:33,571 --> 01:07:37,439
Yeah, he said cops.
They give you that makeover?

808
01:07:39,327 --> 01:07:42,910
They do nice work.

809
01:07:42,997 --> 01:07:45,749
- You want to talk inside?
- No. We're not gonna talk here.

810
01:07:45,833 --> 01:07:49,333
We'll go over the state line
into North Dakota.

811
01:07:49,420 --> 01:07:53,418
If anybody's lookin', we don't
want 'em to find us yet.

812
01:07:54,759 --> 01:07:57,131
Sheriff Decker's a lifer.

813
01:07:57,220 --> 01:07:59,343
Came from the military,
highly decorated.

814
01:07:59,430 --> 01:08:04,057
Been in office eighteen years.
The man controls the town.

815
01:08:04,143 --> 01:08:06,136
Good. A man
used to running things...

816
01:08:06,229 --> 01:08:08,305
gonna think he can run us, too.

817
01:08:11,150 --> 01:08:15,646
Marbles, pay the check.

818
01:08:15,738 --> 01:08:17,530
Matty, you ride with me.

819
01:08:32,296 --> 01:08:33,755
I gotta ask you something.

820
01:08:33,840 --> 01:08:35,916
None of my guys
would even be here...

821
