if they weren't trying
to help me out.

822
01:08:38,636 --> 01:08:41,341
They shouldn't suffer for that,
you know?

823
01:08:41,431 --> 01:08:43,637
If we get that money back...

824
01:08:43,724 --> 01:08:45,598
nothin' happens to Marbles,
all right?

825
