to do things...

826
01:08:49,730 --> 01:08:50,893
and things got done.

827
01:08:50,982 --> 01:08:53,769
No room for whining,
no room for mistakes.

828
01:08:53,860 --> 01:08:58,071
Now, everybody's feelings
are involved.

829
01:08:58,156 --> 01:09:01,322
A guy steps wrong now, he ends
up on the witness stand...

830
01:09:01,409 --> 01:09:04,363
or on the fuckin'
Barbara Walters.

831
01:09:07,957 --> 01:09:11,243
But l'll tell you what, Matty.
Since you're askin'...

832
01:09:11,335 --> 01:09:13,909
