833
01:09:14,005 --> 01:09:18,963
Nothing will happen
to your friend. OIK?

834
01:09:22,263 --> 01:09:23,508
Thanks.

835
01:09:25,766 --> 01:09:29,349
You know, this whole thing's
my fault, anyway.

836
01:09:29,437 --> 01:09:32,853
I figured
l wasn't a kid anymore.

837
01:09:32,940 --> 01:09:37,187
- I figured l was ready for this.
- Age got nothin' to do with it.

838
01:09:37,278 --> 01:09:39,401
You take Taylor,
you put him in that basement...

839
01:09:39,488 --> 01:09:42,324
it don't matter if he's
a toddler or 103 years old.

840
01:09:42,408 --> 01:09:46,904
He's gonna pull that trigger,
and you're not...

841
01:09:46,996 --> 01:09:49,119
'cause you're not made that way.

842
01:09:54,420 --> 01:09:58,916
And that's good, OIK?
Don't get down on yourself...

843
01:09:59,008 --> 01:10:01,214
and the sheriff
will surface soon.

844
01:10:01,302 --> 01:10:03,176
We'll sort the thing out.

845
01:10:14,565 --> 01:10:16,143
You might want to notch it
back there a notch.

846
01:10:16,233 --> 01:10:17,478
