I'm off duty at twelve.

855
01:10:49,600 --> 01:10:51,758
Brickman's Meats.
It's past the tracks.

856
01:10:51,852 --> 01:10:55,352
- So why not now?
- I'll say when.

857
01:10:55,439 --> 01:10:57,598
Bring your friends
if you're worried.

858
01:10:57,691 --> 01:10:59,565
I'll tell you what.
I don't like the sound of this.

859
01:10:59,652 --> 01:11:01,644
If you want to see
your money again...

860
01:11:01,737 --> 01:11:04,109
that's where it's gonna be.

861
01:11:06,450 --> 01:11:08,277
You're not talkin' about
leavin' are ya?

862
01:11:08,369 --> 01:11:09,946
I am.

863
01:11:11,580 --> 01:11:14,332
I think you should
come with me, cuz.

864
01:11:14,416 --> 01:11:16,290
Matty needs us.

865
01:11:16,377 --> 01:11:19,212
Matty's got
all the backup he needs.

866
01:11:19,296 --> 01:11:22,297
Bus rolls by the interstate
and goes to Billings at 11: 15.

867
01:11:22,383 --> 01:11:24,459
I booked us a room
at the Sheraton...

868
01:11:24,551 --> 01:11:26,259
back in New York
by tomorrow morning.

869
01:11:26,345 --> 01:11:28,302
My father works things out
with Benny Chains...

870
01:11:28,389 --> 01:11:31,805
six months from now,
nobody's gonna remember a thing.

871
01:11:36,021 --> 01:11:38,726
No chance. No fuckin' way.

872
01:11:38,816 --> 01:11:40,607
You're my first cousin...

873
01:11:40,693 --> 01:11:43,362
and l have
a responsibility to you.

874
01:11:43,445 --> 01:11:49,531
This whole thing is my fault.
It's my doing and l'm sticking.

875
01:11:51,787 --> 01:11:54,278
If you gotta go, you go.

876
01:12:16,395 --> 01:12:20,179
All right, let's go in and see
how we set this thing up.

877
01:12:22,359 --> 01:12:23,604
