- I go to cash it...

879
01:12:31,326 --> 01:12:33,568
you cancel it the minute
l walk out of town? Nah.

880
01:12:33,662 --> 01:12:36,331
- Borrow it from your friend.
- Hey...

881
01:12:36,415 --> 01:12:39,581
Mr. New York mile-a-minute,
why don't you shut your mouth?

882
01:12:39,668 --> 01:12:42,539
You're makin' my ears hurt.

883
01:12:42,629 --> 01:12:44,337
That'll be enough of that,
fellas.

884
01:12:44,423 --> 01:12:48,551
- Go on and have a drink.
- Ain't none of your business.

885
01:12:53,807 --> 01:12:56,891
You don't want me
to make it my business, huh?

886
01:13:00,355 --> 01:13:01,850
Believe me.

887
01:13:04,067 --> 01:13:05,348
Come on.

888
01:13:16,663 --> 01:13:18,656
Can you imagine
these hillbilly bastards...

889
01:13:18,749 --> 01:13:20,077
