Wait. Matty said
nothing would happen to me.

898
01:13:47,611 --> 01:13:50,944
- Check with Teddy.
- Who do you think sent us?

899
01:13:56,244 --> 01:13:59,578
Come on. Where's Scarpa?

900
01:13:59,664 --> 01:14:00,945
