914
01:17:51,646 --> 01:17:53,769
IKeep this guy talkin',
all right?

915
01:17:55,733 --> 01:18:00,146
Turn off the part of your brain
that thinks. Just react.

916
01:18:00,238 --> 01:18:02,776
It's gonna be a lot louder
