917
01:18:02,865 --> 01:18:04,941
and you might not hit a thing.

918
01:18:18,923 --> 01:18:23,300
Come on. Over there.

919
01:18:27,974 --> 01:18:30,381
So, where are
the other two clowns?

920
01:18:30,476 --> 01:18:32,967
