922
01:18:37,525 --> 01:18:40,395
Come to think of it,
we can find them later.

923
01:18:40,486 --> 01:18:43,736
Slow down, Farmer Brown.

924
01:18:43,823 --> 01:18:46,492
Jim, don't point
a fucking gun at me.

925
01:18:46,575 --> 01:18:49,149
