930
01:19:20,276 --> 01:19:22,518
Hey, arsehole!

931
01:19:22,611 --> 01:19:24,651
Put 'em down.

932
01:19:26,365 --> 01:19:29,734
Put the guns down!

933
01:19:30,870 --> 01:19:32,779
What the fuck is he doin' here?

934
01:19:34,415 --> 01:19:36,621
Well, it's like this, Don.

935
01:19:36,709 --> 01:19:38,785
There's a lot of money
in the bag.

936
01:19:40,921 --> 01:19:42,250
Holy shit!

937
01:19:43,340 --> 01:19:46,010
- Chris.
- Holy shit.

938
01:19:46,093 --> 01:19:49,628
- I thought you'd left us.
- No, l had to come back.

939
01:19:55,728 --> 01:19:57,720
Where's Marbles?

940
01:19:57,813 --> 01:19:59,557
What?
l thought he left with you.

941
01:19:59,648 --> 01:20:01,937
No.
He said he wouldn't leave.

942
01:21:02,920 --> 01:21:05,327
Let's see what we got here.

943
01:21:08,092 --> 01:21:10,927
It was you.

944
01:21:11,011 --> 01:21:14,214
- You came out here to do this.
- I know what l told you, kid...

945
01:21:14,306 --> 01:21:16,762
but nobody fucks up
like your friends did here...

946
01:21:16,850 --> 01:21:19,306
and comes out of it clean. No.

947
01:21:19,394 --> 01:21:23,178
Bullshit. You came out here
to take that money.

948
01:21:30,072 --> 01:21:34,283
There were never any shortages.
You're the one who's been...

949
01:21:34,368 --> 01:21:37,203
robbing from my father,
you son of a bitch.

950
01:21:37,287 --> 01:21:38,947
Matty, it's not like that.

951
01:21:39,039 --> 01:21:41,447
Stop fuckin' tellin' me
how it is, Teddy.

952
01:21:41,542 --> 01:21:44,993
My whole life,
you been tellin' me how it is.

953
01:21:45,087 --> 01:21:48,088
You've been lying to me.

954
01:21:48,173 --> 01:21:50,498
You put me in that basement
with Bobby Boulevard...

955
01:21:50,592 --> 01:21:52,668
