961
01:22:15,826 --> 01:22:17,865
Walkin' off
that handball court...

962
01:22:17,953 --> 01:22:22,033
dumping game after game
to your fucking old man.

963
01:22:23,583 --> 01:22:26,205
Can l tell you,
