964
01:22:26,295 --> 01:22:30,588
carrying a lawn chair
in my left hand...

965
01:22:30,674 --> 01:22:34,339
so, yeah, now l'm takin' mine.

966
01:22:37,347 --> 01:22:40,348
- No, you're not.
- I'm not?

967
01:22:42,728 --> 01:22:47,224
What are you gonna do, Matty?
You gonna shoot me?

968
01:22:47,315 --> 01:22:49,308
You're not gonna shoot me.

969
01:22:54,156 --> 01:22:58,023
I got shoes
older than you, kid...

970
01:22:58,118 --> 01:22:59,660
and tougher, too.

971
01:23:39,117 --> 01:23:40,446
Taylor?

972
01:24:41,221 --> 01:24:42,631
There it is.

973
01:24:42,722 --> 01:24:44,466
Good.

974
01:24:44,557 --> 01:24:48,507
This'll finally get me out of
the shit that Teddy put me into.

975
01:24:48,603 --> 01:24:51,011
Yeah, that's good.

976
01:24:51,106 --> 01:24:55,435
Look,
l know l was wrong about you.

977
01:25:02,325 --> 01:25:08,328
Matty,
you can come in with me now.

978
01:25:12,335 --> 01:25:17,293
You know, there was a time
l really wanted to hear that.

979
01:25:17,382 --> 01:25:21,510
Ever since l was a kid,
l've been tryin' to live up...

980
01:25:21,594 --> 01:25:25,343
to what l thought
you wanted me to be.

981
01:25:25,431 --> 01:25:30,556
I fucked up my whole life
for it...for you.

982
01:25:30,645 --> 01:25:33,812
Matty, l thought
it was what you wanted.

983
01:25:33,898 --> 01:25:35,606
I never wanted you
in this thing.

984
01:25:35,692 --> 01:25:39,061
That's what you said, but you
know the truth, same as l do.

985
01:25:39,153 --> 01:25:43,282
You never once looked at me
like l was a man.

986
01:25:43,366 --> 01:25:48,491
You never would have, either,
if l hadn't have done this.

987
01:25:50,164 --> 01:25:52,204
I'm out.

988
01:25:58,965 --> 01:26:00,957
I'll see ya, Pop.

989
01:26:20,611 --> 01:26:22,818
You told him?

990
01:26:22,905 --> 01:26:26,571
Yeah, l did.

991
01:26:26,659 --> 01:26:30,739
Good.
You're finally done with it.

992
01:26:32,081 --> 01:26:34,074
Done with this, too.

993
01:26:37,503 --> 01:26:39,460
- What now?
- Now?

994
01:26:39,547 --> 01:26:41,338
Now we get the hell outta here.


